{
  "locale": "zh",
  "namespace": "social.scene",
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_INTRO",
      "text": "我有件重要的事想告诉你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_KEY",
      "text": "我喜欢你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_REPLY",
      "text": "我也一直喜欢你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_RESULT",
      "text": "那就一起走下去吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_INTRO",
      "text": "有些话，我还是想再说一次。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_KEY",
      "text": "我们能重新开始吗？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_REPLY",
      "text": "这次别再错过了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_RESULT",
      "text": "重新认识彼此吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_FAIL_REPLY",
      "text": "对不起，我不能答应。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_FAIL_RESULT",
      "text": "……我明白了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BREAKUP_KEY",
      "text": "我们还是到这里吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BREAKUP_REPLY",
      "text": "……我知道了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RECONCILE_KEY",
      "text": "别再这样僵下去了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RECONCILE_REPLY",
      "text": "好，我们重新来过。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.GRIEF_KEY",
      "text": "我会记得你的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CHAT_KEY",
      "text": "嗨。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RIVAL_KEY",
      "text": "这笔账，我不会就这么算了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RIVAL_REPLY",
      "text": "正好，我也没打算和你和解。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  ]
}
